{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01078","headline":"相和歌辞 日出行 · 李贺","name":"相和歌辞 日出行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白日下崐崘，发光如舒丝。\n徒照葵藿心，不照游子悲。\n折折黄河曲，日从中央转。\n阳谷耳曾闻，若木眼不见。\n奈何铄石，胡爲销人。\n羿弯弓属矢那不中，足令久不得奔，讵教晨光夕昏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01078.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01078","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}